# The skills.sh installer (`npx skills@latest add mattpocock/skills`) fans the
# skills out to every coding agent it knows about, plus its own staging dirs.
# This repo only uses Claude Code, so only .claude/skills/ is tracked.
# Patterns are root-anchored so they never hide .claude/skills/ itself.

